    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n105512" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόπᾱλις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιδος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bundle, bunch,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκορόδων τ.</span>
			<i>a bunch</i> of garlic, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ach.</u>
				813
			</span></i> (Megar.). (
				Dor.
			 for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόπηλις,</span> which is
			given with this accent by Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.91
			</span></i>; but in <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
			</span></i> l.c. codd. RA<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Γ</span> have
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροπαλλίδος</span> and <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροφαλλίδος</span>:—cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριοπηλίς</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τριτοπηλίς.</span>)</div>
